QFC Regulations :: Partnership Regulatio.content_text:
(1)	A Partnership is bound by anything done by a Partner for carrying on in the
usual way Business of the kind carried on by the Partners . (2)	But the Partnership is not bound if: (A)	the Partner has no authority to do the thing on behalf of the Partnership ;
and (B)	the person with whom the Partner is dealing: (i) has notice that the Partner has no authority, or (ii) does not know or believe him to be a Partner in the Partnership .
